            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>International Appearances</strong><br>\nTereshkova became a symbol of Soviet achievements in space and represented the USSR in numerous international events, strengthening Soviet ties worldwide.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Personal Life</strong><br>\nDespite her high public profile, Tereshkova has kept her personal life relatively private, marrying fellow cosmonaut Andrian Nikolayev and having a daughter.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Continuing Influence</strong><br>\nEven after the dissolution of the Soviet Union, Tereshkova remained active in space advocacy and politics, reflecting her enduring dedication to her country's space legacy and global cooperation in space exploration.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
